  "remarks": "Moscow Institute of Physics and Technology (MIPT) is one of a Russian institutions that trains professionals for the Russian military and industrial complex. The institute has launched dedicated programs in drone technologies and conducts state-funded drone research. MIPT has a military training centre whose focus is training in the military specialties established for MIPT, corresponding to the main civilian areas of training of the institute. MIPT has several partners that manufacture drones, including the “Almaz-Antey”, the “Kronstadt” design bureau and the “Geoscan”. MIPT is therefore materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex and is supporting and benefitting from the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
